# PennyWise Environment Variables
# ---------------------------------
# Google OAuth 2.0 Web Client ID for Google Drive Cloud Backup.
# In Google Cloud Console:
# 1. Create a project and enable the "Google Drive API".
# 2. Under Credentials, create an OAuth 2.0 Client ID for "Web application".
# 3. Add Authorized JavaScript Origins:
#    - https://penny-wise-one-liard.vercel.app (Production)
#    - http://localhost:5173 (Local development)
# 4. Paste the generated Client ID below:
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
